# CI smoke run: boot → menus (keyboard) → Quick Race → drive a few seconds → pause → quit → menu,
# then exit. Exit 0 = every step ran and the UI stayed healthy; on a stuck step or a UI error the
# exit code is non-zero and the log names the step:
#   cargo run -p recharged -- --user-data-dir <fresh dir> --input-script tools/scripts/smoke.script \
#     --exit-after 120
# Format: docs/design/automation.md.

wait ui
3.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # the splash has timed out; Title: any button
1.0 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # Track select: the focused track → Car select
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
hold keyboardA throttle 1
@120 tap keyboardA item
@240 release keyboardA
0.2 tap keyboardA pause
wait paused
0.5 nav keyboardA down             # Restart
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # How to play
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quit race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # dialog: Cancel focused
0.4 nav keyboardA left             # Quit
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait menu
1.0 exit
